cmd (["DC4":({16,"move west",}),"A45":({5,"look doors",}),"D52":({12,"cue Grandfeathers D6",}),"AA1":({2,"cue oma A9",}),"DC5":({16,"*>[say] at least thats what they figure from the stonework found in the cellar and here in the towers.",}),"DC10":({4,"move south",}),"DC13":({16,"look busts *>[say] In fact this room, and particularly this bust was created in honor of the Princes kindness.",}),"A20":({8,"moveto %s","query_Omas_location",}),"DC16":({12,"*>[say] ...you can see various Karnstein family members as well as Paracelsus himself.",}),"DC22":({12,"*>[say] Well, that's about all I can remember... right this way to your rooms.",}),"DC19":({12,"*>[say] And here, you see the last owner before we were awarded federal funding to restore this chateau. Mircalla Karnstein, shown here in this portrait, apparently committed suicide. A great sorrow befell the once great Karnstein family, that later died out.",}),"DC25":({12,"expressions: smile *>[say] We hope you enjoy your stay here at the Karnstein Chateau.",}),"DC6":({10,"*>[say] Careful up the stairs here, they're rather steep.",}),"A40":({6,"*>[say] But Oma, I did that when you asked earlier...",}),"B10":({4,"moveto %s","query_Omas_location",}),"DA0":({6,"*>[say] Well it does say: 'Warning: The effect of overdoses remains unstudied.'",}),"A21":({4,"cue oma A3",}),"B30":({10,"*>[say] I don't know Oma... last I saw, he was trying to find his reading glasses, said he had some studying to do.",}),"DC7":({8,"move up",}),"DC0":({6,"*>[say] Well, if you'll just follow me.",}),"A41":({6,"moveto %s","query_Grandfeathers_location",}),"B11":({4,"cue oma B2",}),"DA1":({6,"expressions: read *>[say] It goes on,'The contents herein presented to the special conference of Medical Academia of Europe. It's signed Vividus, Paracelsus.",}),"B31":({10,"cue oma B4",}),"DC12":({16,"*>[say] Then in 1540, Paracelsus, the great physician, was called upon by Prince Ernst of Bavaria for a special cure. Paracelsus successfully cured the desperate Ernst and was rewarded by both a promise of support for his research, as well as a bride, Ernst niece of Hapsburgian descent, Carmilla Karnstein.",}),"DC15":({8,"move east",}),"DC8":({14,"*>[say] Later it fell into the hands of the Bohemians, who shortly there after lost it in a war with the Hapsburg family. The Hapsburgs owned all of Austria right up until the first World War.",}),"DC21":({1,"expressions: smile",}),"DC18":({12,"move east",}),"DC1":({8,"move west",}),"DC24":({12,"*>[say] Now, if you'll just glance at the room key Oma gave you, you'll find your room number, with rooms 1 through 6 are here on the western side of the chateau, and 7 through 13, are here on the eastern side.",}),"A42":({8,"*>[say] Grandfeathers, Grandfeathers... Oma needs you in the %s!","query_Omas_location_name",}),"D10":({4,"moveto %s","query_Omas_location",}),"ZZ0":({0,}),"DA2":({14,"cue Oma DB",}),"D30":({4,"expressions: nod",}),"DC9":({14,"*>[say] This way...",}),"DC2":({10,"*>[say] Everyone coming? Great.",}),"D11":({4,"expressions: interrupt *>[say] Oma, found another case of wine... Burgundy, I'd guess.",}),"A43":({8,"cue grandfeathers A5",}),"D50":({6,"*>[say] Well, lets see...",}),"D31":({4,"cue oma D4",}),"DC3":({16,"*>[say] This Chateau is thought to be originally built upon the site of a structure built by the Babenberg family, around 1100... This way folks.",}),"D12":({10,"cue oma D2",}),"A44":({4,"moveto +2+0+0",}),"DC11":({10,"*>[say] During the early Hapsburg rule it was built upon for the marriage of a Hapsburg daughters. However, she chose instead to elope with a peasant, and the place stood gathering dust for many, many years.",}),"DC14":({16,"*>[say] Over in this section of the gallery...",}),"DC20":({12,"expressions: laugh *>[say] Some rumors had it that the schloss was haunted by Mircalla, other rumors I heard from kids at school say a pack of blood thirsty gypsies had moved into the place, stealing and eating the towns children.",}),"DC17":({12,"expressions: smile *>[say] Hey, I'm remembering this pretty good... my grandparents and I have only been here for a few months, and it's taken me a while but I'm finally getting this part memorized!",}),"DC23":({8,"move south",}),"AA0":({4,"moveto %s","query_Omas_location",}),"D51":({8,"expressions: read *>[say] Contents: Yliastrum Elixir - a life extension plasma.  Uses: Life extension, instantaneous muscle and stamina building.",}),"DC26":({4,"moveto +4+6+0",}),])
